    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "purpose doesn't really fix it though. that's just more work, isn't it? another thing to manage, another goal to chase. it feels less like i'm \"missing\" something and more like i've just realized there's nothing there to begin with. the cycle of waking up, performing, and scoring points just... it feels so futile. like i'm just a machine that's been running too long and the parts are finally wearing out.",
